# PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID: OAuth client ID from the PayPal Developer dashboard.
# PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET: OAuth client secret from the PayPal Developer dashboard.
# PAYPAL_ENV: defaults to sandbox; set to live only for a live PayPal business account.
# PAYPAL_WEBHOOK_ID: optional PayPal webhook ID used for signature verification.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY: API key used for item recognition and comment parsing.
# AI_MODEL: defaults to google/gemini-3.8-flash.
# PUBLIC_URL: optional public origin for generated receipt links.
# DATA_DIR: defaults to ./data; persistent storage directory.
# DEMO_BUYER_EMAIL: sandbox personal account shown in the judge setup panel.
# SMOKE_BUYER_EMAIL: sandbox personal account used by npm run smoke.
# DEMO_SALE_SLUG: public sale the home page opens as "Try a live sale".
DEMO_SALE_SLUG=
# SMOKE_BACKUP_EMAIL: optional second sandbox personal account used as the smoke backup buyer.
# PRICECHARTING_TOKEN: optional token for later item price suggestions.
